[agent:result] def _cli_arg_after(tokens: list, cli_binary: str) -> str | None:
[agent:result]     """The CLI service/subcommand token following `cli_binary` in `tokens`
[agent:result]     (e.g. `sagemaker` in `aws sagemaker list-models`), skipping global options
[agent:result]     that may precede it (`aws --region us-east-1 sagemaker …`). None if the
[agent:result]     binary isn't present or no service token follows.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]     Option-value ambiguity resolves AGAINST the caller (fail closed): an
[agent:result]     unknown valueless option swallows the following token, so the service is
[agent:result]     missed and the command denied — never the reverse (`aws --profile
[agent:result]     sagemaker ec2 …` must not read the option's value as the service).
